/**
 * Meson Enquirer — entry point. Creates the Discord client and wires events to their handlers; the logic lives in the modules imported below.
 *
 *  - Tickets (tickets.js): reads Ticket Tool's form embed and the user's later messages, posts each new swap and keeps it current (watch.js); a wallet-only ticket gets that wallet's unfinished swaps, each posted and followed the same way.
 *  - /meson-query (commands.js): look up one swap on demand.
 *
 * Needs the MESSAGE CONTENT privileged intent to read Ticket Tool's embed.
 */
// ----- Contents (generated by `npm run index` — do not edit) -----
// L40   Client
// L45     client
// L53   Events
// L61     forgetChannel()
// L67     on ClientReady
// L83     on MessageCreate
// L85     on InteractionCreate
// L88     on ChannelDelete
// L90     on ThreadDelete
// L93     reconnects
// L96     attemptsTaken()
// L103    on ShardReconnecting
// L109    on ShardDisconnect
